                                "sense_id": "4479cb9e-537e-3373-8e15-b1d635f3c9b8",
                                "text": "His early dreams haunted him like reproaches; and every morning he rose with the full purpose of pursuing some more settled plan: but he lacked motive, he had no one dependent on his industry; and every day he grew to care less and less for hopes, that he now overharshly held to be illusions."
